{"ID":"20240206105019-8aulf5f","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206105019-8aulf5f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105019-8aulf5f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105027-3qp454z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105022-7wwwleu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105027-3qp454z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:211,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:211\u0026#125;","title":"鸡骨草","type":"doc","updated":"20240903093337"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105027-3qp454z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105027-3qp454z","updated":"20240206105030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产两广地区。\n【性状】\t该品根多呈圆锥形，上粗下细，有分枝，长短不一，直径0.51.5cm；表面灰棕色，粗糙，有细纵纹，支根极细，有的断落或留有残基；质硬。茎丛生，长50100cm，直径约0.2cm；灰棕色至紫褐色，小枝纤细，疏被或密被短柔毛。羽状复叶互生，小叶811 对，多脱落，小叶矩圆形，广州相思子叶长0.81.2cm，毛相思子叶长1.2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.4cm，先端平截，有小突尖，下表面被伏毛。气微香，味微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、微苦，凉。\n【功效】\t清热解毒，舒肝止痛。用于黄疸，胁肋不舒，胃脘胀痛；急、慢性肝炎，乳腺炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105022-7wwwleu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105022-7wwwleu","updated":"20240730164036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105022-xl3m53f.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240730162208-k7esd36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730162208-k7esd36","updated":"20240730162719"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 633px;","style":"width: 623px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 10-20240730162602-exmmad2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 623px;\" parent-style=\"width: 633px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 632px;","style":"width: 622px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 8-20240730162349-s3j483l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 622px;\" parent-style=\"width: 632px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730162010-nsabvtu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730162010-nsabvtu","updated":"20240730162409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 726px;","style":"width: 716px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草-20240730153021-ig6ma4h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 716px;\" parent-style=\"width: 726px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 547px;","style":"width: 537px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 9-20240730162409-4g2e9ce.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 537px;\" parent-style=\"width: 547px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730162110-sdqbhtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730162110-sdqbhtz","updated":"20240903093102"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 467px;","style":"width: 457px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (18)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 18-20240903093102-gdqwx6c.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 457px;\" parent-style=\"width: 467px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 5-20240730162110-nf7d83o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 298px;","style":"width: 288px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (15)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 15-20240730164010-zm4s5sa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 288px;\" parent-style=\"width: 298px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730163104-nrxpfk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730163104-nrxpfk5","updated":"20240730163424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 427px;","style":"width: 417px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 11-20240730163334-yw172sw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 417px;\" parent-style=\"width: 427px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 428px;","style":"width: 418px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 12-20240730163424-3ps13p8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 418px;\" parent-style=\"width: 428px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 429px;","style":"width: 419px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 13-20240730163524-67oa4w1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 419px;\" parent-style=\"width: 429px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240730153336-up1p2fb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730153336-up1p2fb","updated":"20240730163735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 645px;","style":"width: 635px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 3-20240730153336-6schi9e.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 635px;\" parent-style=\"width: 645px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 487px;","style":"width: 477px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 14-20240730163710-l83lite.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 477px;\" parent-style=\"width: 487px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240903092948-d0hv0uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903092948-d0hv0uw","updated":"20240903093015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (16)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 16-20240903092948-57hbalj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 509px;","style":"width: 499px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"鸡骨草 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/鸡骨草 17-20240903093015-uxs6r3h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 499px;\" parent-style=\"width: 509px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240730152831-w0ej8fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240730152831-w0ej8fw","updated":"20240730163756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：鸡骨草与相思藤较为相似，有毛鸡骨草，无毛相思藤；（相思豆种子是红黑相间的，鸡骨草种子是灰褐色）"}]},{"ID":"20240730152831-4mzs49i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240730152831-4mzs49i"}},{"ID":"20240903093331-up2lqeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-up2lqeb","updated":"20240903093337"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：鸡骨草"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-kburw6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-kburw6n","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡骨草《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-4a0yn8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-4a0yn8g","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīGǔCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-2xsdzau","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-2xsdzau","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】HERBAABRI"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-t3b3muo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-t3b3muo","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】红母鸡草、石门坎、黄食草、细叶龙鳞草、大黄草"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-pwcwgkz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-pwcwgkz","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为豆科植物广州相思子AbruscantoniensisHance的干燥全株。全年均可采挖，除去泥沙，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-1m5uwt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-1m5uwt2","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品根多呈圆锥形，上粗下细，有分枝，长短不一，直径0.5～1.5cm；表面灰棕色，粗糙，有细纵纹，支根极细，有的断落或留有残基；质硬。茎丛生，长50～100cm,直径约0.2cm；灰棕色至紫褐色，小枝纤细，疏被短柔毛。羽状复叶互生，小叶8～11对，多脱落，小叶矩圆形，长0.8～1.2cm，先端平截，有小突尖，下表面被伏毛。气微香，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-4xqwb77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-4xqwb77","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-6o54je4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-6o54je4","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末灰绿色。非腺毛单细胞，先端尖或长尖，长60～970μm，直径12～22μm,壁厚3～6μm，层纹明显，有疣状突起。气孔平轴式。纤维束周围细胞含草酸钙方晶，形成晶纤维，含晶细胞壁不均匀增厚。石细胞类圆形、类方形或长圆形，直径16～40μm,有的壁稍厚。木栓细胞黄棕色。草酸钙方晶直径5～11μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-e93qtsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-e93qtsv","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粗粉约10g,加70％乙醇100ml,加热回流30分钟，滤过，滤液分成二份,蒸干。其中一份残渣加水10ml使溶解，滤过，取滤液2ml,加0.1％三氯化铁冰醋酸溶液2ml,摇匀，沿管壁缓缓加入硫酸2ml,接界面即显红棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-0albgno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-0albgno","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取鉴别（2）项下另一份残渣，加1％盐酸溶液10ml使溶解，滤过，残渣加10％氢氧化钠溶液10ml，加热回流30分钟，放冷，移至分液漏斗中，加乙醚20ml振摇提取，分取乙醚液，蒸干，残渣加冰醋酸1ml使溶解，加醋酐19份与硫酸1份的混合液1ml,即显黄色，渐变为污绿色。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-rd1zj9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-rd1zj9t","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质及荚果，切段。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-m313lvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-m313lvj","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、微苦，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-up8xlua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-up8xlua","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-8uz3qsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-8uz3qsd","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热解毒，舒肝止痛。用于黄疸，胁肋不舒，胃脘胀痛；急、慢性肝炎，乳腺炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-fk5zghq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-fk5zghq","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】15～30g。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-vjphg4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-vjphg4n","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】本品种子有毒，不能入药，用时必须把豆荚全部摘除。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-qhi6y46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-qhi6y46","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-2ekapyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-2ekapyx","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-i0d0gp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-i0d0gp5","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡骨草《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-39r1y5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-39r1y5e","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《岭南采药录》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-yh4mf9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-yh4mf9e","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīGǔCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-69rem3t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-69rem3t","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】黄头草、黄仔蔃、大黄草（《岭南采药录》），假牛甘子、红母鸡草（《南宁市药物志》），猪腰草（《广东中药》Ⅱ），黄食草、小叶龙鳞草（广州部队《常用中草药手册》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-beyqtzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-beyqtzs","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为豆科植物广东相思子的带根全草。全年可采。取全株，除去荚果（荚果有毒）及杂质，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-tvoo777","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-tvoo777","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】木质藤本，长达1米，常披散地上或缠绕其他植物上。主根粗壮，长达60厘米。茎细，深红紫色，幼嫩部分密被黄褐色毛。双数羽状复叶，小叶7～12对，倒卵状矩圆形或矩田形，长5～12毫米，宽3～5毫米，膜质，几无柄，先端截形而有小锐尖，基部浅心形，上面疏生祖毛，下面被紧贴的粗毛，叶脉向两面凸起；托叶成对着生，线状披针形；小托叶呈锥尖状。总状花序腋生，花长约6毫米；萼钟状；花冠突出，淡紫红色；雄蕊9，合生成管状，与旗瓣贴连，上部分离；子房近于无柄，花柱短。荚果矩圆形，扁平，疏生淡黄色毛，先端有尾状凸尖；种子4～5粒，矩圆形，扁平，光滑，成熟时黑褐色或淡黄色，有明显的种阜。花朋春、夏。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-nrpm793","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-nrpm793","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于山地或旷野灌木林边。分布广东、广西等地。产广东、广西。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-ch7jl0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-ch7jl0j","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥的带根全草，多缠扎成束。根长短粗细不等，主根圆柱状或圆锥状，表面灰褐色，具纵横皱纹，侧根多与主根垂直横生；主根坚硬，不易折断。茎藤状，粗1.5～2.5毫米，表面灰棕色，粗糙，小枝红棕色，较平滑；质坚，断面不平。气微，味淡。以干燥、洁净，根、茎、叶全者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-62llbcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-62llbcl","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】全草含相思子碱胆碱、甾醇化合物、黄酮类、氨基酸、糖类。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-bdhraqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-bdhraqm","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】相思子碱腹腔注射，能降低小鼠肩部由葡萄球菌毒索引起的炎症反应；对兔的实验性贫血无治疗效果，高浓度（1：500）可抑制羊血球的溶解。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-jgmn2wu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-jgmn2wu","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】洗净，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-txo48s9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-txo48s9","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-e8lojj5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-e8lojj5","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-vjp6l0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-vjp6l0a","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《南宁市药物志》：\"甘，平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-shycguu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-shycguu","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《岭南草药志》：\"味微甘，性凉。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-6r9xlir","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-6r9xlir","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-kwl2108","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-kwl2108","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清热解毒，舒肝散瘀。治黄疸肝炎，胃痛，乳痈，瘰疬，跌打伤瘀血疼痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-6w4193k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-6w4193k","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《南宁市药物志》：\"消炎解毒。治传染性肝炎，跌打驳骨。叶：捣绒敷乳疮。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-d0yvr3w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-d0yvr3w","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《中国药植图鉴》：\"治风湿骨痛，跌打瘀血内伤；并作清凉解热药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-1ekunxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-1ekunxc","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《岭南草药志》：\"清郁热，舒肝，和脾，续折伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-oeb939a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-oeb939a","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④广州部队《常用中草药手册》：\"清热利湿，舒肝止痛。治急慢性肝炎，肝硬化腹水，胃痛，小便刺痛，蛇咬伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-zo53a61","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-zo53a61","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3～5钱，或入丸、散。外用：捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-05dl4cs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-05dl4cs","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-mkll2xc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-mkll2xc","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治黄疸：鸡骨草二两，红枣七、八枚。煎服。（《岭南草药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-qyoja5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-qyoja5o","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治瘰疬：鸡骨草六斤，稀莶草四斤。研末，蜜为丸，每丸重一钱。日服三次，每次二丸，连服二至四周。（广西《中草药新医疗法处方集》）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-j4si4dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-j4si4dd","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】治疗急性传染性肝炎:取干鸡骨草全草2～3两（儿童1～2两），瘦猪肉2两，加水1000毫升同煎。沸后文火再煎至300毫升，每日3次分服，直至痊愈为止.治疗44例，治愈42例，治愈时间平均为21天。黄疸消失平均为15天；肝功能恢复一般为18～21天；肝肿大随肝功能的恢复逐渐恢复正常。治程中未见不良反应。对慢性肝炎效果不佳。曾报道1例重症肝炎（严重黄疸合并昏睡）患者，服鸡骨草煎剂每次60毫升，日服3次，4天后，神志开始清楚，小便增多，第5天自觉症状显着减轻，第14天自觉症状消失，黄疸不显，第19天一般情况恢复正常，停药观察，肝功能逐渐恢复。住院共38天痊愈出院。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-sfu4fk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-sfu4fk9","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-k5qdjcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-k5qdjcb","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鸡骨草《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-5klvcju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-5klvcju","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《岭南采药录》。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-110gk6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-110gk6b","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】JīGǔCǎo"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-8e7atkj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-8e7atkj","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】AbrusHerb,HerbofChinesePrayer-Beads"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-fj6i4pu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-fj6i4pu","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】黄头草、黄仔强、大黄草、假牛甘子、红母鸡草、猪腰草、黄食草、小叶龙鳞草、"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-jjtujy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-jjtujy2","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-tv942qq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-tv942qq","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为豆科植物广东相思子的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-96sn6hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-96sn6hr","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：AbrusCantoniensisHance[A.fruticulosusWall.exWightetArn.]"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-9aku84t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-9aku84t","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年可采收，一般在11-12月或清明后连根挖起，除去荚果（种子有毒）去净根部泥土，将茎藤扎成束，晒至八成干发汗再晒足干即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-k8f5klc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-k8f5klc","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】广东相思子攀援灌木，长达1m；小枝及叶柄被粗毛。主根粗壮，长达60cm。茎细，深红紫色，幼嫩部分密被黄褐色毛。偶数羽状复叶；小叶7-12对，倒卵状形或长圆形，长5-12mm，宽3-5mm，先端截形而有小芒尖，基部浅心形，上面疏生粗毛，下面被紧贴的粗毛，小脉两面均突起；托叶成对着生。总状花序短，腋生；花长约6mm；萼钟状；花冠突出，淡红色；雄蕊9，合生成管状，与旗瓣紧贴，上部分离；子房近于无柄，花柱短。荚果长圆形，扁平，被疏毛，有种子4-5颗。种子长圆形，扁平，褐黑色，种阜明显，蜡黄色，中间有孔，边缘为1长圆形的环，脐褐色针刺状，紧靠荚缘。花期8月，果期9-10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-2q45myw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-2q45myw","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-vt1346t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-vt1346t","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于山地或旷野灌木林边。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-gdp6pwv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-gdp6pwv","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-eaohhbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-eaohhbf","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-o7i96nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-o7i96nn","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖、潮湿、怕寒冷，耐旱，忌涝。以疏松、肥沃的壤土、砂质壤土、轻粘土、pH5-6.5的环境为适宜。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-oz9qnxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-oz9qnxq","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术在生产主要采用育苗移栽法繁殖，也可以用直播及分根繁殖。种子采用磨擦法和热水浸种法处理，以提高发芽率。2-5月播种，点播或撒播。点播株行距2cm×3cm，播后盖1cm厚的砂土或火灰，喷水保温，并盖稻草一层。1h㎡播种量为150kg。移栽：播后4-7d出苗，出齐后10d施1次人畜粪水(每1kg兑水20kg)，或施用少量的复合化肥，30-45d当苗高10-12cm时即可移植至大田。行株距为30cm×40cm或30cm×30cm，栽后及时淋水，每月除草、松土1-2次。鸡骨草生长前期约4-5月，每月施肥1次，以尿素0.1kg或硫酸铵0.2kg，兑水50kg以促进苗生长；生长中期约6-8月生长旺盛，以磷钾兼施，每月1h㎡用氮、磷、钾复合肥75-120kg兑水或尿素1.5kg，或硫酸铵3.0kg，兑水1500kg粪水进行沟施。生长中后期即9月以后，配合有机肥，1h㎡施过磷酸钙375-450kg，猪牛粪3750-4500kg，当茎藤蔓高30cm时(4-6月)，在株间插好支架以利蔓茎攀援。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-ihne34y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-ihne34y","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治①根腐病：注意雨季排水，撒施草木灰，喷施1：1：100波尔多液或1000倍多菌灵防治。②炭疽病：雨天注意排水，发病时用1：3：300波尔多液喷洒，或用1500倍甲基托布津防治。③蚜虫：可用化学药剂防治。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-2jut9mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-2jut9mh","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-69k1fwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-69k1fwa","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别本品为带根全草，多缠绕成束。根圆柱形或圆锥形，有分枝，长短粗细不等，直径3-15mm；表面灰棕色，有细纵纹；质硬。根茎短，结节状。茎丛生，长藤状，长可达1m，直径1.5-2.5mm；表面灰褐色，小枝棕红色，疏被毛茸；偶数羽状复叶，小叶长圆形，长8-12mm，下表面被伏毛。气微，味微苦。以根粗、茎、叶全者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-9f1fjgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-9f1fjgz","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别茎横切面：木栓层细胞充满黄棕色物质。皮层狭窄。中柱鞘由石细胞和纤维组成，纤维周围的细胞含草酸钙方晶，形成晶纤维。维管束韧皮部呈帽状；导管直径15-75μm，木射线及木薄壁细胞含淀粉粒和少数方晶。髓细胞类圆形。叶表面观：上表皮细胞垂周壁呈波状弯曲；非腺毛单细胞；沿叶脉有晶纤维。下表皮气孔平轴式，偶见不定式；非腺毛较多。粉末特征：灰绿色。①非腺毛单细胞，长160-800μm，直径12-22μm，壁厚3-6μm，先端急尖，壁有疣状突起。②晶纤维周围含晶细胞壁不均匀增厚，内含草酸钙方晶。直径5-11μm。③石细胞类圆形、类方形或长圆形，直径16-40μm，有的壁稍增厚。④气孔平轴式。⑤木栓细胞黄棕色。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-7dsx227","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-7dsx227","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-3lkpmsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-3lkpmsn","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"全草粗皂甙水解产物含多种三萜类皂甙元：相思子皂醇(abrisapogenol)A、C、B、D、E、F、G，大豆皂醇(soyasapogenol)A、B，葛根皂醇(kudzusapogenol)A，槐花二醇(sophoradiol)广东相思子三醇(cantoniensistriol)，甘草次酸(glycyrrhetinicacid)，光果甘草内酯(glabrolide)。还含相思子皂甙(abrisaponin)1，胆碱(choline)和相思子碱(abrine)。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-j8ssi00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-j8ssi00","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根中含大黄酚(chrysophanol)和大黄素甲醚(physcion)。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-4h30g5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-4h30g5q","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-zisdjx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-zisdjx0","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.对肠平滑肌的影响对于正常离体家兔回肠，鸡骨草根煎剂可显着增强其收缩幅度，麻醉兔灌胃或肌注煎剂也能使在位肠管张力提高，蠕动略增强。在离体豚鼠回肠试验中高浓度煎剂对乙酰胆碱所致的收缩有明显抑制作用，但对组胺所致仅有轻度抑制，对氯化钡所致者无影响。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-51lwjom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-51lwjom","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.增强小鼠游泳耐力鸡骨草根煎剂5g/kg灌服可显着增强小鼠游泳耐力。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-issafgw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-issafgw","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.其他作用鸡骨草粗皂甙对四氯化碳（CCl4）所致肝损伤有显着保护效果。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-du3tej3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-du3tej3","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.毒性鸡骨草煎剂腹腔注射526g/kg，或630g/kg，或灌服420g/kg，3d内均不引起死亡。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-m99gbia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-m99gbia","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】(1)取本品粗粉10g，加70%乙醇100ml，置水浴中加热回流30min，滤过，滤液置水浴上挥尽乙醇，残渣加1%盐酸溶液10ml使溶解，滤过。取滤液3份，每份1ml，供下列试验：①加碘化铋钾试液1滴，产生橘红色沉淀。②加碘化汞钾试液1滴，产生灰黄色沉淀。③加硅钨酸试液1滴，产生乳白色沉淀。(检查生物碱)(2)取上述1%盐酸不溶物，加1%氢氧化钠溶液10ml，水浴中加热回流30min，放冷，移至分液漏斗中，加乙醚20ml振摇提取，分取乙醚液，挥干，残渣加冰醋酸1ml溶解，加醋酐19份与硫酸1份的混合液1ml，显黄色，渐变为污绿色。（检查甾类化合物）"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-tkgrri4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-tkgrri4","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】洗净，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-nqbrd6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-nqbrd6s","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】甘、苦；凉；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-ohnzesv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-ohnzesv","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】心；肺；肝；胃；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-uuo6gj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-uuo6gj9","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清热利湿，散瘀止痛。主黄疸型肝炎，胃痛，风湿骨痛，跌打瘀痛，乳痛"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-1dte8ft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-1dte8ft","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，15-30g；或入丸、散。外用：适量，鲜品捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-me6nqj2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-me6nqj2","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】凡虚寒体弱者慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-kww2bql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-kww2bql","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-47gcpox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-47gcpox","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《南宁市药物志》：消炎解毒，治传染性肝炎，跌打驳骨。叶：捣绒敷乳疮。2.《中国药植图鉴》：治风湿骨痛，跌打瘀血内伤；并作清凉解热药。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-kn879x2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-kn879x2","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《岭南草药志》：清郁热，舒肝，和脾，续折伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-jmn3aeb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-jmn3aeb","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.广州部队《常用中草药手册》：清热利湿，舒肝止痛。治急慢性肝炎，肝硬化腹水，胃痛，小便刺痛，蛇咬伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240903093331-2a45hvy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093331-2a45hvy","updated":"20240903093356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240903093333-j3f4yrg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240903093333-j3f4yrg","updated":"20240903093356"}},{"ID":"20240903093334-fv5fzxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240903093334-fv5fzxe","updated":"20240903093356"}}]}